# pnpm writes this file and pnpm owns its formatting. Prettier will happily
# reformat it — 6,634 lines on the first run — which buys nothing, guarantees a
# conflict on the next `pnpm install`, and is exactly the kind of diff nobody
# reads. There is no .prettierrc here either, so `prettier --write .` runs on
# defaults over everything it recognises; this file is what keeps that from
# being a destructive command.
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Build output and deploy artefacts. Generated, gitignored, and large.
.next/
.vercel/
out/

# Prose, which is hand-wrapped here and reads worse for being machine-wrapped.
# Prettier rewrites `*emphasis*` as `_emphasis_`, and on AGENTS.md it
# de-indented a list item's continuation line — enough to break the bullet it
# belonged to. The value of a formatter is on code, where the rules are
# arbitrary and consistency is the whole point; a paragraph's line breaks are a
# choice someone made.
*.md
